<node id="paper:W4283735679">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">A novel CNN+LSTM classification model based on fashion-MNIST</data>
  <data key="d6">A novel CNN+LSTM classification model based on fashion-MNIST</data>
  <data key="d5">2022</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.1117/12.2639667</data>
  <data key="d8">9</data>
  <data key="d9">Nowadays, Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) based image recognition is a popular research direction. This study uses the Fashion-Mnist dataset, which is more challenging than the Mnist dataset. aims to add Long short-term memory (LSTM) to the structure of CNN to create a hybrid model of CNN and LSTM, called CNN+LSTM model. This model is used to complete and optimize the image classification problem on Fashion-Mnist dataset. The final image classification accuracy of the obtained model is 91.36%, which still needs to be improved, but the accuracy results are better compared to the accuracy of other models.</data>
</node>
