  <data key="d6">No more meta-parameter tuning in unsupervised sparse feature learning</data>
  <data key="d5">2014</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.1402.5766</data>
  <data key="d8">5</data>
  <data key="d9">We propose a meta-parameter free, off-the-shelf, simple and fast unsupervised feature learning algorithm, which exploits a new way of optimizing for sparsity. Experiments on STL-10 show that the method presents state-of-the-art performance and provides discriminative features that generalize well.</data>
