  <data key="d9">This is a copy of the SVHN dataset (http://ufldl.stanford.edu/housenumbers/), that has been formatted to work with both `cuda-convnet2` (https://github.com/akrizhevsky/cuda-convnet2) and `nengo_extras` (https://github.com/nengo/nengo_extras). I take no credit for this dataset.</data>
