<node id="paper:W3185122212">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Few Shot Learning Based on the Street View House Numbers (SVHN) Dataset</data>
  <data key="d6">Few Shot Learning Based on the Street View House Numbers (SVHN) Dataset</data>
  <data key="d5">2021</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">In recent years, deep learning model has made remarkable achievements in image, voice, text recognition and other fields. However, deep learning model relies heavily on large number of labeled data, which limits its application in the special field of data shortage.</data>
