<node id="paper:W4393540329">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Tiny-ImageNet-R</data>
  <data key="d6">Tiny-ImageNet-R</data>
  <data key="d5">2022</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6653674</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">Tiny-ImageNet-R, is a down-sampled subset of ImageNet-R(enditions) imagenet-r. It contains roughly 12,000 samples categorized in 64 classes (a subset of Tiny-ImageNet classes), spread across multiple visual domains such as art, cartoons, sculptures, origami, graffiti, and embroidery.</data>
