  <data key="d9">Training deep networks with a biologically plausible algorithm. Implementation of BrainProp, a biologically plausible learning rule that can train deep neural networks on image-classification tasks (MNIST, CIFAR10, CIFAR100, Tiny ImageNet).</data>
