<node id="paper:W7124148630">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">PASCAL VOC</data>
  <data key="d6">PASCAL VOC</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.31069564</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">The PASCAL VOC (Pattern Analysis, Statistical Modelling and Computational Learning Visual Object Classes) dataset is a classic benchmark dataset for general visual object recognition and detection, which covers 20 categories of common objects and has become an important reference for algorithm performance comparison in the field of computer vision due to its standardized evaluation system and open dataset partitioning scheme.</data>
