  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">In this paper, we will introduce sn-open mapping. by using it, certain sn-first countable spaces are characterized as images of metric spaces under various sn-open mappings. In particular, this paper give the relation between sn -open mapping and 1-sequence-covering mapping.</data>
