  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Quotient and Pseudo-Open Images of Separable Metric Spaces</data>
  <data key="d6">Quotient and Pseudo-Open Images of Separable Metric Spaces</data>
  <data key="d5">1972</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.1090/s0002-9939-1972-0300253-7</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">Ernest A. Michael has given a characterization of the regular quotient images of separable metric spaces. His result is generalized here to a characterization of the ${T_1}$ quotient images of separable metric spaces (which are the same as the ${T_1}$ quotient images of second countable spaces). This result is then used to characterize the Hausdorff pseudo-open images of separable metric spaces.</data>
