  <data key="d9">Brief summaries including: 'Townscapes and Cityscapes' by Patricia S. Eldredge; 'Youngstown's Mill Creek Park' by Rebecca M. Rogers; 'The Forgetten Gilded Age Townscape of Warren, Ohio' by Alexander T. Bobersky; 'Kinsman, Ohio in the Gilded Age: The Final Flowering of a Small Town' by Richard Webb. Abstracts; Originally published in Western Reserve Studies Symposium (8th:1993 : Cleveland, Ohio).</data>
