  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">This content includes synthetic and real datasets of foggy and dusty weather in traffic scenarios, with coco format detection boxes. The synthetic dataset comes from Cityscapes and can be used for subsequent image dehazing, image dust removal, and object detection tasks.</data>
