<node id="paper:W7128391443">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">HMDB51 (Optical flow extracted &amp; with fuzzy rule description)</data>
  <data key="d6">HMDB51 (Optical flow extracted &amp; with fuzzy rule description)</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18524355</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">This is the processed HMDB51 dataset associated to paper entitled: Knowledge-Guided Multi-Task Video Classification for Industrial Process via Fuzzy Rule Graph Embedding. The corresponding official code repository is avaliable at https://github.com/Galazxhy/KG-MTVC.git. The original HMDB51 dataset is avaliable at HMDB51: Human Motion Database - Serre Lab.</data>
