<node id="paper:W2626764787">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Deep Learning Methods for Efficient Large Scale Video Labeling</data>
  <data key="d6">Deep Learning Methods for Efficient Large Scale Video Labeling</data>
  <data key="d5">2017</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.1706.04572</data>
  <data key="d8">14</data>
  <data key="d9">We present a solution to "Google Cloud and YouTube-8M Video Understanding Challenge" that ranked 5th place. The proposed model is an ensemble of three model families, two frame level and one video level. The training was performed on augmented dataset, with cross validation.</data>
</node>
<node id="author:miha škalič">
  <data key="d0">Author</data>
  <data key="d1">Miha Škalič</data>
