<node id="paper:W4382492135">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">CLEVR Text Retrieval for 'Are Diffusion Models Vision-and-Language Reasoners?'</data>
  <data key="d6">CLEVR Text Retrieval for 'Are Diffusion Models Vision-and-Language Reasoners?'</data>
  <data key="d5">2023</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8096755</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">We present several datasets in our paper and this is one of them: CLEVR Text Retrieval with synthetic images and text to probe phenomena like spatial understanding.</data>
</node>
