<node id="paper:W3166583735">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Malayalam Visual Genome 1.0</data>
  <data key="d6">Malayalam Visual Genome 1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">2021</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">Data ------- Malayalam Visual Genome (MVG for short) 1.0 has similar goals as Hindi Visual Genome (HVG) 1.1: to support the Malayalam language. Malayalam Visual Genome 1.0 is the first multi-modal dataset in Malayalam for machine translation and image captioning. Malayalam Visual Genome 1.0 serves in "WAT 2021 Multi-Modal Machine Translation Task". Malayalam Visual Genome is a multimodal dataset consisting of text and images suitable for English-to-Malayalam multimodal machine translation task and multimodal research. We follow the same selection of short English segments (captions) and the associated images from Visual Genome as HGV 1.1 has. For MVG, we automatically translated these captions from English to Malayalam and manually corrected them, taking the associated images into account.</data>
</node>
