<node id="paper:W2136931265">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Visual Genome Explorer™: A Comparative Visual Interface to Genome Data</data>
  <data key="d6">Visual Genome Explorer™: A Comparative Visual Interface to Genome Data</data>
  <data key="d5">1997</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.2144/97226bc06</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">In response to the deluge of genome data, we are developing Visual Genome Explorer, an interactive graphical interface to genome data. Given is a description of the prototype program, which introduces the concept of visual comparative genomics for complete bacterial genomes.</data>
</node>
