<node id="paper:W4398305996">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">ShapeNet with camera and lighting variations</data>
  <data key="d6">ShapeNet with camera and lighting variations</data>
  <data key="d5">2023</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.7910/dvn/ielffy</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">This dataset was generated for the paper: "Adversarial examples within the training distribution: A widespread challenge" using our custom computer graphics pipeline. The paper can be accessed here: https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.16198 and the code used to generate this dataset can be found here: https://github.com/Spandan-Madan/in_distribution_adversarial_examples</data>
