Dont lead your team into battle without the help of X-SQUAD: PRIMAS OFFICIAL STRATEGY GUIDE. Inside, youll find strategies for commanding your 4-person squad, complete weapons stats, detailed maps, bios of all team members and enemies, a helpful explanation of tactical orders, and much more!</data>
