  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">Benchmark artifact bundle accompanying the paper "dx3-ENRICH: Graph-Enriched Retrieval in a Production Hybrid SQL+Vector+Graph System" (arXiv, 2026). Contains the complete evaluation harness (Python), per-question result JSON for all reported runs (primary, robustness, and smoke configurations), baseline system implementations, and reproduction instructions for the HotpotQA fullwiki evaluation at 66,541-article scale. The HotpotQA dataset itself is not vendored; the README provides official download instructions (HotpotQA is CC BY-SA 4.0). All reported metrics (SF title-match, SF F1, SF EM, BCa bootstrap CI) are recomputable from the included per-question JSONs.</data>
