  <data key="d9">We built the NLI corpus resources as inputs used in this research by adopting the sentence pairs in the SNLI corpus (Bowman et al 2015), which were translated into Indonesian and named SNLI Indo. This language transfer process used the assistance of the Google Translate API. Besides, based on a background as a pioneer of intelligent translator engines, Google Translate can still be relied on to translate simple sentences using standard and neat phrase levels</data>
