  <data key="d6">SST-2 BERT representation analysis</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23130757</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">Initial release of frozen BERT representation analysis on SST-2. Includes analysis scripts, five-seed results, summary generation, figures, reproducibility instructions, and MIT license.</data>
