<node id="paper:W7220384256">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">IMDb reviews Jojo Rabbit and The Zone of Interest</data>
  <data key="d6">IMDb reviews Jojo Rabbit and The Zone of Interest</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22937783</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dataset was to compiled to discern viewers' empathic engagement with the protagonists of Taika Waititi's Jojo Rabbit (2019) and twenty-five on Jonathan Glazer's The Zone of Interest (2023). The dataset includes fifty reviews scraped from IMDb, twenty-five on Jojo Rabbit (on April 29, 2026) and twenty-five on The Zone of Interest (on May 1, 2026). Reviews were selected according to the following criteria:user reviews by private persons (no external or professional reviewers)English languageall ratingshighest votes received (most interaction)These selection criteria are intended to ensure that the selected reviews resonate with other viewers of the film who might not have published their own review. Files starting with JR are reviews of Jojo Rabbit; files starting with ZoI are reviews of</data>
</node>
