  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Coding for 100 files of alt.atheism of the 20 Newsgroups dataset</data>
  <data key="d6">Coding for 100 files of alt.atheism of the 20 Newsgroups dataset</data>
  <data key="d5">2023</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8337722</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">The zip file contains the first (lexicographic ordering) 100 files of the alt.atheism class of the 20 Newsgroup dataset coded to eleven categories.</data>
