  <data key="d1">Introduction to the CoNLL-2003 shared task</data>
  <data key="d6">Introduction to the CoNLL-2003 shared task</data>
  <data key="d5">2003</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.3115/1119176.1119195</data>
  <data key="d8">2736</data>
  <data key="d9">We describe the CoNLL-2003 shared task: language-independent named entity recognition. We give background information on the data sets (English and German) and the evaluation method, present a general overview of the systems that have taken part in the task and discuss their performance.</data>
