  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">English Model (CoNLL-2003) for NameTag</data>
  <data key="d6">English Model (CoNLL-2003) for NameTag</data>
  <data key="d5">2014</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">English model for NameTag, a named entity recognition tool. The model is trained on CoNLL-2003 training data. Recognizes PER, ORG, LOC and MISC named entities. Achieves F-measure 84.73 on CoNLL-2003 test data.</data>
