  <data key="d6">Abstractive Summarization of Document using Dual Encoding Framework</data>
  <data key="d5">2020</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5120/ijca2020920544</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">Popularity of the web is increasing day by day and social media is becoming a huge source of information.It becomes difficult to analyze this enormous information quickly.Text summarization solves this problem, it minifies text such that repeated data are removed and important information is extracted and represented in the concise way which can help us to understand the information instantly.It is impossible to summarize all this information manually as it contains a huge number of unstructured information and reviews.Manual summarization is a tedious, monotonic and time consuming task.Therefore, method is needed for mining and summarizing information, reviews and produce representative summaries.To deal with this problem, an abstractive summarization of documents using an encoder decoder</data>
