  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">A mixed-license dataset and reproducibility artifact covering six exact Mixtral and Qwen3 GGUF deployments on 100 shared GSM8K items. P4R1 scored Mixtral Q4/IQ2/IQ1 at 68/46/26 and Qwen at 91/97/96. The package contains privacy-sanitized item-level outcomes, deterministic paired-statistics checks, exact model and environment provenance, replication sources, and the accompanying technical report. The experiment is corrective and exploratory, not independent; the ladders are not precision-matched, and the results establish neither an architectural cause nor Qwen-tier equivalence. Benchmark text, model responses, and weights are excluded. AI assistance: Claude (Anthropic) assisted with evaluation-harness development and experiment orchestration. Claude and Codex (OpenAI) assisted with evidenc</data>
