<node id="paper:W4377864567">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">The HCCL system for VoxCeleb Speaker Recognition Challenge 2022</data>
  <data key="d6">The HCCL system for VoxCeleb Speaker Recognition Challenge 2022</data>
  <data key="d5">2023</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2305.12642</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">This report describes our submission to track1 and track3 for VoxCeleb Speaker Recognition Challenge 2022(VoxSRC2022). Our best system achieves minDCF 0.1397 and EER 2.414 in track1, minDCF 0.388 and EER 7.030 in track3.</data>
</node>
