<node id="paper:W2690546603">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">Movielens 20M Dataset</data>
  <data key="d6">Movielens 20M Dataset</data>
  <data key="d5">2017</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.17632/n6sjkpy87f.3</data>
  <data key="d8">9</data>
  <data key="d9">Movielens 20M contains about 20 million rating records of 27,278 movies rated by 138493 users between 09 January,1995 to 31 March 2015 . Each user has rated a movie from 1 to 5, where 1 being the worst and 5 is the best. In this study we have considered only positive ratings we have considered higher than 2 as positive rating.</data>
