  <data key="d6">MovieLens Tag Genome for Property Graph Benchmark</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.7910/dvn/q3ttxr</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">This is an adapted version of the MovieLens Tag Genome dataset (https://grouplens.org/datasets/movielens/tag-genome-2021/). This dataset is for a graph database benchmark project and we modified some files to speed up import for these graph database platforms. The following transformations were applied to the original MovieLens Genome 2021 dataset to prepare it for loading into TigerGraph: 1. reviews_with_id.json (Review vertices with generated review_id) o Added a unique review_id field using monotonically_increasing_id() to satisfy TigerGraph's primary key requirement (original reviews.json lacks a unique identifier) o Each review contains: review_id, text, and item_id (movie being reviewed) o Enables creation of HAS_REVIEW edges from Movie to Review 2. survey_answers_with_id.json (Surve</data>
</node>
