  <data key="d9">The Cora co-citation network is a hypergraph where nodes are scientific papers from the Cora dataset and hyperedges are sets of papers that are co-cited together by another paper. Each node is labeled with the paper's research field, chosen from seven computer science topics. This dataset is commonly used as a benchmark in hypergraph learning tasks. Find the dataset details in AHORN.</data>
