  <data key="d0">Author</data>
  <data key="d1">Zara Kanaeva</data>
</node>
<node id="paper:W4387391431">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">CiteSeer(M10),DBLP(V4),SDBLP</data>
  <data key="d6">CiteSeer(M10),DBLP(V4),SDBLP</data>
  <data key="d5">2023</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8414239</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">Three citation network datasets, including the academic network dataset CiteSeer (M10), DBLP (Data Base systems and Logic Programming) (V4), SDBLP (Simplified Data Base systems and Logic Programming). SDBLP is to removal the nodes with less than 3 references in the DBLP.</data>
</node>
