  <data key="d9">KEY POINTS Recent reports that PubMed, one of the world’s leading biomedical databases, includes predatory journals and their publications[1][1],[2][2] is cause for concern. PubMed handles millions of queries daily and represents a key source of knowledge for health researchers worldwide. Much</data>
