<node id="paper:W7215015320">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">TGA_SUCCESSOR_CONFIRM2_CXR_20260926: pre-registration of a confirmatory multi-reader study of per-patient harm from an AUROC-better chest radiograph model update and review of its footprint (CheXpert test set, 8 radiologists)</data>
  <data key="d6">TGA_SUCCESSOR_CONFIRM2_CXR_20260926: pre-registration of a confirmatory multi-reader study of per-patient harm from an AUROC-better chest radiograph model update and review of its footprint (CheXpert test set, 8 radiologists)</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">Pre-registration (hash-frozen) of study 2 of the TGA successor programme (study 1: https://osf.io/h5d96/). An AUROC-better model update is evaluated per patient against 8 radiologists on the CheXpert test set, with a retrain-only placebo, and routing only the decisions the update changes to review is tested. Freeze ID (SHA-256 of receipts/FREEZE.json): f278ce06552de1858e4e23c5aa5337c68928d0cc13fbaaaab6ea245513540716. PREREGISTRATION.md is the frozen document; the zip holds FREEZE.json, protocol, all code, tests, data receipts, the review record and SHA256SUMS.txt. Posted before any model output on the evaluation data was computed. Training data: NIH ChestX-ray14 (NIH Clinical Center). Evaluation data: CheXpert test set (Stanford AIMI); no images or labels are redistributed here. PI: Daniel</data>
</node>
