<node id="paper:W7172314534">
  <data key="d0">Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">NIH ChestX-ray14 - 25 Publication Figures (Rad-DINO LoRA, Test 0.8462)</data>
  <data key="d6">NIH ChestX-ray14 - 25 Publication Figures (Rad-DINO LoRA, Test 0.8462)</data>
  <data key="d5">2026</data>
  <data key="d7">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21765511</data>
  <data key="d8">0</data>
  <data key="d9">25 publication-quality figures (1200x800 px PNG, 3:2 aspect) supporting the SOTA result of 0.8462 macro AUROC on the NIH ChestX-ray14 test set (n=25,596) with Rad-DINO ViT-B/14 + LoRA (r=16, all-linear, +safe_augment, grid=37) + AttentionPoolProbe. Figures cover: headline metrics, per-class ROC/PR/F1, calibration, ECE, confusion matrices, score distributions, NLP label-noise ceiling analysis, Youden thresholds, lineage milestones, training curves, A/B head x grid heatmap, VRAM/throughput, label co-occurrence, class prevalence, multi-label prediction distribution, F1-vs-threshold sensitivity, cross-class transferability, and a live single-CXR inference breakdown.</data>
</node>
